#sortorder:10
#showas:掠夺者狂潮
A rather fun and odd scenario. An increased number of factions, and it's set to difficulty 7.
This difficulty is good for someone who has spent some time in AI War 2.

This is on the "honeycomb" map type, with 70 planets. Zombifyier AI type, which heavily uses units capable of turning enemies into allied Zombies.
Your starting fleet is set to "Raid," which is focused on aggression and getting far into enemy territory.

The main focus here however, are 3 Marauder factions, all at Intensity 7 and hostile to everyone. They are human pirates that will occasionally appear and attack everyone, with the goal of capturing the planet to use as a base to strengthen themselves.

They are hostile to each other as well, so this can lead to very interesting and amusing clashes over territory.

The Zenith Trader is also wandering around as a neutral third party, selling big weapons and defensive items
to you or the AI as it goes.  Make sure to visit the Build tab when it is on one of your planets.